{"channelId":"UCY_JdRvy--RpP6BZHJF1D6w","row":["DeClue Equine, LLC",977,"Equine Sports Medicine Veterinarian Audrey DeClue and Podcaster of \"The Horse First Podcast\" uncovers the science of undiagnosed conditions such as Equine Shivers and Stringhalt (Shivers-Stringhalt Syndrome), Equine Headshaking Syndrome, Idiopathic Hopping in Ridden horses, Girthy horses, Sleep Deprivation in horses and many other lameness issues in sport horses.  A simple six step approach is used to solve conditions affecting horses and equid species for centuries: \n1. History of the condition\n2. KISS Theory (Keep It Simple Stupid)\n3. Anatomy and \"Ologies\"\n4. Form=Function\n5. The Curiosity of Why?\n6.Thinking for Yourself!\n\nCome join her for the ride of undiagnosed horses in the field of equine sports medicine!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY_JdRvy--RpP6BZHJF1D6w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY_JdRvy--RpP6BZHJF1D6w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:33.228Z","channelId":"UCY_JdRvy--RpP6BZHJF1D6w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"918becf87edb459256b9702a3a1daa84a33f2463b2d8074b940b2b1d31c290bd","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"fad1340972aed7dd2da0c4081ddb88613804d6055d9fb888c9da3fe2bc6d97e1"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY_JdRvy--RpP6BZHJF1D6w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:07:02.236Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY_JdRvy--RpP6BZHJF1D6w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":977,"raw":"977 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY_JdRvy--RpP6BZHJF1D6w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:33.228Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"media_or_education","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY_JdRvy